---
config:
  flowchart:
    nodeSpacing: 150
    rankSpacing: 80
  themeVariables:
    edgeLabelBackground: 'transparent'
---
flowchart TD
    Worker([worker message])
    RunGuard{Run is running?}
    Pending[Execution pending]
    Supersede[Mark prior running attempts stale]
    Running[Execution running]
    AttemptRunning[Attempt running]
    AgentAndEvaluators[Invoke agent and run evaluators]
    TerminalGuard{Current attempt still authoritative?}
    AggregateGuard{Aggregate available or failure transition?}
    AttemptCompleted[Attempt completed]
    ExecutionCompleted[Execution completed]
    AttemptAgentFail[Attempt failed agent call]
    AttemptEvalFail[Attempt failed evaluation]
    ExecutionFailed[Execution failed]
    Cancel([run cancel])
    ExecutionCancelled[Execution cancelled]
    AttemptCancelled[Attempt cancelled]
    RetryScheduled[Execution retry scheduled]
    TimedOut[Timed out]
    Awaiting[Awaiting evaluators]
    Stale[Attempt stale]
    Reject[Reject stale transition]

    Worker --> RunGuard
    RunGuard -- Yes --> Pending --> Supersede --> Running --> AttemptRunning --> AgentAndEvaluators
    RunGuard -- No --> Reject
    Supersede --> Stale

    AgentAndEvaluators --> TerminalGuard
    TerminalGuard -- Yes --> AggregateGuard
    TerminalGuard -- No --> Stale

    AggregateGuard -- Completed with aggregate --> AttemptCompleted --> ExecutionCompleted
    AggregateGuard -- Agent invocation failed --> AttemptAgentFail --> ExecutionFailed
    AggregateGuard -- Evaluation or persistence failed --> AttemptEvalFail --> ExecutionFailed
    AggregateGuard -- Missing required aggregate --> Reject

    Running --> Cancel
    Pending --> Cancel
    AttemptRunning --> Cancel
    Cancel --> ExecutionCancelled
    Cancel --> AttemptCancelled

    Running -. Reserved retry path .-> RetryScheduled
    Running -. Reserved partial path .-> Awaiting
    Running -. Reserved timeout path .-> TimedOut
    AttemptRunning -. Reserved timeout path .-> TimedOut

    class Worker,Cancel command
    class RunGuard,Pending,Supersede,Running,AttemptRunning,AgentAndEvaluators,TerminalGuard,AggregateGuard,Awaiting,RetryScheduled system
    class AttemptCompleted,ExecutionCompleted success
    class AttemptAgentFail,AttemptEvalFail,ExecutionFailed,ExecutionCancelled,AttemptCancelled,TimedOut,Reject error
    class Stale component
